---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="About Us | Ruhani Creations by Sumati"
  description="Learn about founder Sumati Aswani and the design philosophy behind Ruhani Creations by Sumati, a creative studio rooted in hand-painted artistry and thoughtful making."
>
  <main class="content-main">
    <section class="page-hero">
      <div class="container page-hero-grid">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">About Us</p>
          <h1>A design-led creative studio shaped by emotion, hand-painting, and meaningful detail.</h1>
          <p class="page-intro">
            Ruhani Creations by Sumati is rooted in handmade beauty, where clothing, painted accents, and future lifestyle pieces all carry softness, refinement, and the intimacy of something thoughtfully created.
          </p>
          <div class="story-ribbon">
            <a class="story-chip" href="#founder">Founder Story</a>
            <a class="story-chip" href="#brand">Brand Philosophy</a>
            <a class="story-chip" href="#values">Our Values</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="brand-mark-card">
          <img class="page-mark" src="/assets/RCBS_Logo_dark.PNG" alt="Ruhani Creations by Sumati logo">
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="container page-stack">
      <section id="founder" class="page-panel split-panel">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Founder</p>
          <h2>Sumati Aswani</h2>
          <p>
            I am Sumati Aswani, founder of Ruhani Creations, an artist with a deep love for beauty, detail, and meaningful expression. My journey began with hand-painting, a quiet and personal practice that gradually became a signature part of who I am and how I create.
          </p>
          <p>
            What started as a passion for colour and brushwork evolved into a creative path shaped by emotion, refinement, and individuality. My work draws from the poetry of everyday moments, the softness of nature, and the elegance found in handmade artistry.
          </p>
          <p>
            I create with the intention of bringing together sensitivity and sophistication, pieces that feel personal, timeless, and soul-stirring. For me, art is more than something to be seen; it is something to be felt. Each creation carries a story, a mood, and a piece of my creative spirit.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="detail-card">
          <h3>What defines Sumati’s approach</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Painterly colour choices and delicate detailing</li>
            <li>Design decisions guided by emotion, not only trend</li>
            <li>A preference for pieces that feel elevated yet personal</li>
            <li>Direct involvement in the creative and customer journey</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="brand" class="page-panel">
        <p class="eyebrow">Brand Story</p>
        <h2>Where handmade art becomes a wider design language.</h2>
        <p>
          The brand was born from the art of hand-painting and from a love of transforming simple surfaces into expressive, one-of-a-kind pieces. What began as a personal form of artistic exploration gradually blossomed into a creative studio rooted in craftsmanship, beauty, and intentional design.
        </p>
        <p>
          At its heart, Ruhani Creations by Sumati celebrates the charm of handmade art with a refined and modern sensibility. Every piece is approached with care, inspired by emotion, detail, and the desire to create something truly distinctive, whether it becomes an outfit, a dupatta, a gifting piece, or a functional object.
        </p>
        <p>
          This brand is an extension of Sumati’s artistic journey: a space to create meaningful work that feels both delicate and elevated, intimate and timeless.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section id="values" class="page-panel">
        <p class="eyebrow">What Guides Us</p>
        <div class="value-grid">
          <article class="policy-card">
            <span class="policy-tag">01</span>
            <h3>Artistry First</h3>
            <p>Hand-painted influence, colour sensitivity, and thoughtful finishing remain central to every collection and every styling decision.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="policy-card">
            <span class="policy-tag">02</span>
            <h3>Personal Expression</h3>
            <p>The goal is not to produce something generic. Each piece is intended to feel expressive, warm, and memorable for the person wearing it.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="policy-card">
            <span class="policy-tag">03</span>
            <h3>Refined Support</h3>
            <p>Customers receive direct guidance for fit, occasion selection, appointments, and final confirmation through simple and personal communication.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>